        "valueString": "Approx. 6/9 right and 6/9 left on Snellen in room; repeated due to distractibility. Able to read a number plate across the car park."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-7",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-7",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left eye symptoms"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Reports a little wing of skin in the left eye present for years, noticed mainly after others commented on redness. Over the past 6–9 months, intermittent redness and mild irritation, worse on the left than right, especially after full days onsite in wind and dust; occasional gritty sensation relieved by blinking or rinsing; mild dryness at the end of the day. End-of-day left-eye blur settles after overnight rest. Driving, including at night, and reading are okay."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-8",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-8",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Eye symptom negatives"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Denies significant pain, photophobia, discharge, foreign-body sensation, trauma, halos, diplopia, and headache."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-9",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-9",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "General appearance"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Well appearing, talkative, no acute distress."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-10",
      "resource": {
        "resourceType": "Observation",
        "id": "observation-10",
        "status": "final",
        "code": {
          "text": "Left eye examination"
        },
        "subject": {
          "reference": "Patient/patient-1"
        },
        "valueString": "Nasal conjunctival fibrovascular growth, triangular, extending approximately 2.5–3 mm onto the cornea from the limbus and not near the visual axis. Mild conjunctival injection around the lesion. No ulceration, obvious dellen, or purulent discharge."
      }
    },
    {
      "fullUrl": "https://example.org/fhir/Observation/observation-11",
